		{"id":"21819fe799b04321","type":"text","x":5370,"y":7500,"width":350,"height":250,"color":"2","text":"**A-279 / AST-0279｜I11 废设施训练场**\n来源标签：`ZN + N + X并Z`\nS4候选：`zx / nz`\n实际感受：UNKNOWN / NOT_MEASURED"},
